Date: Wed, 11 Sep 2024 18:14:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 234/913] plat-stm32mp1: scmi_server: use
 DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER_PM()

Replace DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER() directives with DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER_PM()
for resources that need to be unpaged for PM sequence support. This
change covers the resources used by generic core and stm32mp15
platforms.

Also add keep.h inclusions that are missing.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 49890e7ff128bc3715f5fe900e2545606c3fd5d6 plat-stm32mp1: scmi_server: use DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER_PM()]
